{"4749600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Star Fable", "steam_appid": 4749600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a world that grows with you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the heights of Mirror Mountain, descend into the Blue Gloom Mines, wander the Boomshroom Meadows, and jump into the hustle of Castle Town Desire.  Every map is packed with secret areas and sealed passages that only new star powers can open.  Will you remember where to return as the world unfolds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/d97ac7da95d0a50e8d5492326d979eba.poster.avif?t=1784825556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/d97ac7da95d0a50e8d5492326d979eba.webm?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/d97ac7da95d0a50e8d5492326d979eba.mp4?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve a world of diverse puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chase ghosts of stardust through foggy forests. Ignite a Supernova to blast slap-happy gnomes from the path. Direct Starfire through a maze to open locked chambers.  Crack open each puzzle and uncover more than 100 collectables hidden along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/a20ee10a2b6611433b2b6515bf64789d.poster.avif?t=1784825556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/a20ee10a2b6611433b2b6515bf64789d.webm?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/a20ee10a2b6611433b2b6515bf64789d.mp4?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Call on companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the Star Princess sleeps her companions wake.  Summon Slurp to soak up poison puddles or squeeze into a collapsed tunnel.  Call on Fibbit to march through blazing infernos or to weigh down switches.  Conjure Puft to soar over bottomless pits.  Each companion reaches the places a princess never could.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/b0b7a8d3387d24805fdc90f3e62cd232.poster.avif?t=1784825556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/b0b7a8d3387d24805fdc90f3e62cd232.webm?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/b0b7a8d3387d24805fdc90f3e62cd232.mp4?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grant wishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look into the hearts of the people you meet and listen to their stories.  Use your star powers to discover what they truly desire: to break free from a snowy curse, to recover a stolen artifact, or to hear a mother’s lullaby again.  Make their wish come true.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/5217f3c06647d45654322cd439a6c606.poster.avif?t=1784825556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/5217f3c06647d45654322cd439a6c606.webm?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/5217f3c06647d45654322cd439a6c606.mp4?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Style your Star Hero</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize the Star Princess before the adventure begins.  Then collect hats, outfits, shoes, and jewelry to style the perfect hero: from full plate armor to witchy hats and heels to comfy casual suits.  Mix and match until she looks exactly the way you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/31e000acefa9275c5e0c2b294f7e55c7.poster.avif?t=1784825556\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/31e000acefa9275c5e0c2b294f7e55c7.webm?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/31e000acefa9275c5e0c2b294f7e55c7.mp4?t=1784825556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a world that grows with you</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the heights of Mirror Mountain, descend into the Blue Gloom Mines, wander the Boomshroom Meadows, and jump into the hustle of Castle Town Desire.  Every map is packed with secret areas and sealed passages that only new star powers can open.  Will you remember where to return as the world unfolds?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4749600/extras/d97ac7da95d0a50e8d54923